📊 Transfer Learning Strategies

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

1️⃣ Feature Extraction

* Freeze pre-trained model
* Only train final layer

👉 Fast but less flexible

---

2️⃣ Fine-Tuning

* Train entire model
* Adjust weights

👉 Better performance

---

📊 Comparison

| Method             | Training | Performance |
| ------------------ | -------- | ----------- |
| Feature Extraction | Faster   | Moderate    |
| Fine-Tuning        | Slower   | High        |

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

🧠 Advantages

✔ High accuracy
✔ Less data required
✔ Faster development
✔ State-of-the-art performance

---

❌ Challenges

❌ Large model size
❌ High memory usage
❌ Requires GPU
❌ Overfitting if not tuned properly

-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

⚠️ Best Practices

✔ Use pre-trained models (BERT, GPT)
✔ Start with small learning rate
✔ Use early stopping
✔ Use proper tokenization
✔ Monitor validation loss

